Dispose Me Make Commands

Usage:
	make <target>

Targets:
	audit    Run recursive high-severity security audit (yarn audit)
	test     Run tests (yarn test)
	lint     Run linter (yarn lint)
	deploy   Deploy app (yarn deploy)
	start    Start the app (yarn start)
	upgrade  Upgrade dependencies interactively (yarn upgrade-interactive)
	usage    Show this help
